<DocsExample TExample="DialogBasicExample" Title="Confirmation dialog" Description="Call OpenAsync on the component reference to show the dialog. Buttons with command=request-close and a value close it, and OnClosed reports the value." />
<DocsExample TExample="DialogDismissExample" Title="Close button and backdrop" Description="ShowCloseButton adds a header close control, CloseOnBackdrop dismisses on an outside click, and Icon adds a leading glyph. Escape closes by default." />
<DocsExample TExample="DialogDestructiveExample" Title="Destructive action" Description="ButtonSpacing.SpaceBetween separates a secondary action from the confirming pair. Use it for irreversible actions that need an explicit decision." />
